{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is close, take it and check; if not, move and scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToSearchArea    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = CheckObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />\"",
